[
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "# [14] Cloud Azure",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📋 Panoramica",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Materia dedicata a Microsoft Azure con copertura completa: architettura, identità/governance, reti virtuali, compute (VM, App Service, Functions, Container/AKS), storage, AI/Foundry e security/BC/DR. 18 moduli progressivi con slide.",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Tecnologie**: Microsoft Azure, Entra ID, Virtual Network, VM, App Service, Functions, AKS, Blob Storage, AI Foundry, Defender, Key Vault, Backup/DR",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "block_property": "divider"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📚 Indice degli argomenti",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "1. Introduzione ad Azure",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Cos'è il cloud computing**: IaaS, PaaS, SaaS",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Modelli di deployment**: pubblico, privato, ibrido",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Regioni e zone di disponibilità**: replicazione geografica, residenza dati",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**SLA**: 99.9% → 99.999% a seconda della configurazione",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "2. Architettura e Strumenti di Accesso (2-3)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Portal**: GUI web",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure CLI / PowerShell**: automazione e scripting",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Resource Manager (ARM)**: API unificata per provisioning",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Arc**: gestione risorse on-premise e multi-cloud",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Blueprint**: template di conformità",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "3. Identity e Governance (4-5)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Microsoft Entra ID** (ex Azure AD): directory tenant, SSO, MFA",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**RBAC** (Role-Based Access Control): ruoli, scope, azioni consentite",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Policy**: regole di governance per risorse",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Management Groups**: gerarchia di sottoscrizioni",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Privileged Identity Management (PIM)**: accesso JIT a ruoli privilegiati",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "4. Reti su Azure (6-8)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Virtual Network (VNet)**: isolamento rete, addressing, subnets",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Peering VNet**: connessione tra VNet (stessa regione o cross-region)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**VPN Gateway**: sito-sito, punto-sito",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure DNS**: risoluzione nomi",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Load Balancer**: pubblico/interno, livello 4",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Application Gateway**: WAF, routing livello 7",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Front Door / Traffic Manager**: routing globale",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "5. Compute: VM, App Service, Functions (9-12)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Virtual Machines**: IaaS, immagini, scaling set, dischi (managed/unmanaged)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**App Service**: PaaS per web app, auto-scaling, slot deployment",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Functions**: serverless, trigger (HTTP, timer, queue), Durable Functions",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Container Instances / AKS**: container PaaS / Kubernetes orchestrato",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Opzioni scaling**: verticale (VM più grande) vs orizzontale (più istanze)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "6. Storage e Dati (13-14, 16)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Blob Storage**: dati non strutturati (hot/cool/archive tier)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**File Storage**: condivisioni SMB, Azure File Sync",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Disk Storage**: SSD/HDD managed per VM",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Sicurezza storage**: crittografia lato server/ client, SAS tokens, firewall",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Database gestiti**:",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "- **Azure SQL**: SQL Server managed",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "- **Cosmos DB**: NoSQL globale, multi-model (document, graph, key-value, column-family)",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "- **Data Integration**: Data Factory, Synapse Analytics",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "7. AI su Azure (15)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure AI Foundry**: portale per modelli AI (OpenAI, vision, speech)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**AI Services**: Vision, Language, Speech, Decision",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**GitHub Copilot**: AI pair programmer (parte del modulo)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Cognitive Search**: ricerca semantica con AI enrichment",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "8. Security, Reliability, BC/DR (17-18)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Microsoft Defender for Cloud**: security posture, vulnerability assessment",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Key Vault**: gestione di secret, chiavi, certificati",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Azure Backup**: backup di VM, file, database",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Disaster Recovery**: Site Recovery per failover regionale",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Business Continuity**: RPO, RTO, SLA planning",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "block_property": "divider"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "⚡ Punti Chiave",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Tutto in Azure è un Resource Group**: raggruppa risorse per ciclo di vita",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**RBAC è il metodo primario di autorizzazione**: minimo privilegio sempre",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Reti**: VNet sono isolate di default — peering per connetterle",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Costi**: Prestare attenzione ai tier di storage, VM dimensionamento, egress",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Sicurezza**: Key Vault per secret, Defender per posture, MFA sempre",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Backup non è DR**: backup protegge da cancellazione, DR da disastro regionale",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "block_property": "divider"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📎 Risorse Collegate",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
